Welcome to the zorg.ch IRC!

Available Services:
- NickServ: Manage your nickname registration
- ChanServ: Channel management and protection
- MemoServ: Send offline messages to users
- HostServ: Request a custom virtual host

Quick Start:
1. Register your nick:    /msg NickServ REGISTER password email
2. Register a channel:    /msg ChanServ REGISTER #channel
3. Get channel operator:  /msg ChanServ OP #channel

Need help?
Contact IRC Operators:
- keep3r (Network Admin)
- inex (Server Admin)

or Type:
/msg NickServ HELP
/msg ChanServ HELP

For more information visit: https://zorg.ch/forum.php
